  abstract = {THIS PAPER ESTIMATES TREND INFLATION FOR BRAZIL, USING A MODEL OF UNOBSERVED COMPONENTS AND STOCHASTIC VOLATILITY. THE MODEL ALLOWS A FLEXIBLE DYNAMICS BETWEEN TREND INFLATION AND SURVEY INFLATION EXPECTATIONS. ESTIMATED TREND INFLATION HAS BEEN ON A DOWNWARD TREND SINCE 2017, AND HAS NOT BEEN SIGNIFICANTLY AFFECTED BY THE SURGE IN INFLATION FOLLOWING THE COVID-19 OUTBREAK.},
